@startuml dominio
!include dss-dominio.iuml
skinparam minClassWidth 120
skinparam nodesep 40
skinparam ranksep 60
title Domain Model - supermarket item registration and payment (complete model)
' Every element is supported by Appendix A or by a decision in decisoes_dominio.md (D<n>).
' Views with fewer elements: dominio_lojas.puml, dominio_compras.puml,
' dominio_validacao.puml, dominio_campanhas.puml, dominio_pagamento.puml

' ---------- names with spaces ----------
class "Customer Card" as CustomerCard
class "Staff Member" as StaffMember
class "Support Assistant" as SupportAssistant
class "Assisted Checkout" as AssistedCheckout
class "Self-Service Station" as SelfServiceStation
class "Station Mode" as StationMode
class "Self-Checkout Mode" as SelfCheckoutMode
class "Phone-Payment Mode" as PhonePaymentMode
class "Section Scale" as SectionScale
class "Checkout Scale" as CheckoutScale
class "Assisted Purchase" as AssistedPurchase
class "Self-Checkout Purchase" as SelfCheckoutPurchase
class "Scan-While-Shopping Purchase" as ScanWhileShoppingPurchase
class "Purchase State" as PurchaseState
class "Food Product" as FoodProduct
class "Validation Policy" as ValidationPolicy {
  basePercentage : Decimal
  amountThreshold : Decimal
}
class "Validation Outcome" as Outcome
class "No Discrepancy" as NoDiscrepancy
class "Small Discrepancy" as SmallDiscrepancy
class "Unexplained Discrepancy" as UnexplainedDiscrepancy
class "Campaign Application" as CampaignApplication
class "Card Credit" as CardCredit
class "Percentage Discount" as PercentageDiscount {
  percentage : Decimal
}
class "Quantity Discount" as QuantityDiscount {
  quantityTaken : Integer
  quantityPaid : Integer
}
class "Coupon Campaign" as CouponCampaign
class "Cross Discount" as CrossDiscount
class "Card Credit Campaign" as CardCreditCampaign
class "Bank Card Payment" as BankCardPayment
class "Cash Payment" as CashPayment
class "Meal Card Payment" as MealCardPayment
class "Voucher Payment" as VoucherPayment
class "Card Balance Payment" as CardBalancePayment
class "Return Voucher" as ReturnVoucher {
  amount : Decimal
}
class "Item Registration" as ItemRegistration {
  registeredAt : DateTime
  unitPrice : Decimal
}
class Station {
  number : Integer
}
class Weighing {
  weight : Decimal
  weighedAt : DateTime
  price : Decimal
}
class Label {
  code : String
}
class Campaign {
  start : DateTime
  end : DateTime
}
class Coupon {
  expiryDate : Date
}
class Payment {
  amount : Decimal
  sequence : Integer
}
class Void {
  voidedAt : DateTime
}

' ---------- stores, stations, queues, staff ----------
Store "1" -- "*" Station : has >
AssistedCheckout -up- Station : is a >
SelfServiceStation -up- Station : is a >
SelfServiceStation "*" -- "1" StationMode : works in >
SelfCheckoutMode -up- StationMode : is a >
PhonePaymentMode -up- StationMode : is a >
AssistedCheckout "1" -- "1" CheckoutScale : has >
SelfServiceStation "1" -- "0..1" CheckoutScale : has >
Store "1" -- "*" Queue : has >
Queue "0..1" -- "1..*" Station : leads to >
Display "0..1" -- "1" Queue : calls next customer from >
Store "1" -- "*" StaffMember : employs >
Operator -up- StaffMember : is a >
SupportAssistant -up- StaffMember : is a >
Supervisor -up- StaffMember : is a >
Operator "0..1" -- "0..1" AssistedCheckout : operates >
SupportAssistant "1" -- "1..*" SelfServiceStation : watches >

' ---------- person, card, phone ----------
Person "1" -- "1..*" CustomerCard : owns >

' ---------- purchases and registrations ----------
Purchase "*" -- "1" Store : made in >
Purchase "*" -- "0..1" CustomerCard : identified by >
AssistedPurchase -up- Purchase : is a >
SelfCheckoutPurchase -up- Purchase : is a >
ScanWhileShoppingPurchase -up- Purchase : is a >
Purchase "*" -- "1" PurchaseState : is in >
AssistedPurchase "*" -- "1" Operator : registered by >
Purchase "*" -- "0..1" Station : paid at >
Purchase "1" -- "*" ItemRegistration : contains >
ItemRegistration "*" -- "1" Product : of >
FoodProduct -up- Product : is a >

' ---------- weighed items ----------
SectionScale "1" -- "*" Weighing : performs >
CheckoutScale "1" -- "*" Weighing : performs >
Weighing "*" -- "1" Product : of >
Weighing "1" -- "0..1" Label : printed on >
ItemRegistration "0..1" -- "0..1" Weighing : priced by >

' ---------- voids ----------
Void "0..1" -- "1" ItemRegistration : cancels >
Void "*" -- "0..1" Supervisor : authorised by >

' ---------- validation ----------
Validation "0..1" -- "1" ScanWhileShoppingPurchase : checks >
Validation "*" -- "1" StaffMember : performed by >
Validation "1" -- "0..1" Outcome : ends with >
NoDiscrepancy -up- Outcome : is a >
SmallDiscrepancy -up- Outcome : is a >
UnexplainedDiscrepancy -up- Outcome : is a >
SmallDiscrepancy "0..1" -- "1..*" ItemRegistration : adds >
UnexplainedDiscrepancy "0..1" -- "1" AssistedPurchase : sends purchase to >
ValidationPolicy "*" -- "*" Product : flags as problematic >
Store "1" -- "1" ValidationPolicy : configures >

' ---------- campaigns ----------
Campaign "*" -- "*" Product : covers >
PercentageDiscount -up- Campaign : is a >
QuantityDiscount -up- Campaign : is a >
CouponCampaign -up- Campaign : is a >
CrossDiscount -up- Campaign : is a >
CardCreditCampaign -up- Campaign : is a >
CrossDiscount "*" -- "1..*" Product : requires purchase of >
CouponCampaign "1" -- "*" Coupon : issues >
Coupon "*" -- "1" CustomerCard : issued to >
Campaign "1" -- "*" CampaignApplication : applied as >
CampaignApplication "*" -- "1..*" ItemRegistration : concerns >
Discount -up- CampaignApplication : is a >
CardCredit -up- CampaignApplication : is a >
CardCredit "*" -- "1" CustomerCard : credited to >
Discount "*" -- "0..1" Coupon : redeems >

' ---------- payments ----------
Payment "*" -- "1" Purchase : settles >
BankCardPayment -up- Payment : is a >
CashPayment -up- Payment : is a >
MealCardPayment -up- Payment : is a >
VoucherPayment -up- Payment : is a >
CardBalancePayment -up- Payment : is a >
VoucherPayment "*" -- "1" ReturnVoucher : redeems >
CardBalancePayment "*" -- "1" CustomerCard : draws on >

' ---------- constraints the diagram cannot express ----------
note top of Purchase
  Mode constraints (D3, D21):
  - Assisted Purchase is paid at an Assisted Checkout;
  - Self-Checkout Purchase is registered and paid at a
    Self-Service Station working in Self-Checkout Mode;
  - Scan-While-Shopping Purchase is paid at a Self-Service
    Station working in Phone-Payment Mode and must be
    identified by a Customer Card (D24).
  Purchase State: open, awaiting validation, paid, cancelled,
  sent to assisted checkout (D4, D19).
end note

note right of ItemRegistration
  unitPrice = price in force at registeredAt; campaigns are
  evaluated at registeredAt, never at payment time (D8).
  If priced by a Weighing: unitPrice = Weighing.price, i.e.
  the price at weighing time (D9).
  A line counts for payment only if it has no Void and its
  Purchase is not "sent to assisted checkout" (D4).
  A line is concerned by at most one Campaign Application:
  the one most advantageous to the customer (D11).
end note

note bottom of Weighing
  Each Weighing is performed by exactly one scale (Section
  Scale or Checkout Scale); a Label is printed only for
  Section Scale weighings (D22).
  A weighed product in a Scan-While-Shopping Purchase must be
  priced by a labelled Weighing (D30).
end note

note bottom of Coupon
  Single use: at most one Discount redeeming a Coupon may
  belong to a purchase that is not cancelled; a cancelled
  purchase makes the coupon available again (D13, D19).
  Not usable after expiryDate.
end note

note bottom of ReturnVoucher
  Arrives already issued (D18). Single use (same rule as
  Coupon, restored if the purchase is cancelled, D19); the
  part of the amount not used in the purchase is lost.
end note

note bottom of MealCardPayment
  Amount <= value of the not-voided Food Product lines of
  the purchase, after their discounts (D17).
end note

note bottom of CardCredit
  Never deducted from the purchase total; credited to the
  card for later purchases (D14). Requires an identified card.
end note

note bottom of Payment
  sequence = fixed order of application (D16): return
  vouchers, meal card, card balance, bank card / cash.
  Cancelled purchase (D19): voucher and card-balance payments
  are undone (voucher and balance available again); money
  already paid by bank card / cash follows the store refund
  process, outside the system.
end note

note bottom of ValidationPolicy
  Configured per store (D6): base random percentage, reduced
  by the card's validations with No Discrepancy (D5); forced
  above amountThreshold or when a flagged product is
  registered. No values fixed in the model.
end note

note bottom of Outcome
  Small vs unexplained is decided by the validating staff
  member, no numeric threshold (D7).
end note

note bottom of Void
  Authorisation by a Supervisor is required when the voided
  line value is above the threshold set by the store (D20).
end note
@enduml
